Third-party software:
- The plain build (hr-buzz/build.sh) contains no third-party libraries. It uses only the Android
  platform.
- The Play Store build (hr-buzz/ondevice/build.sh release) additionally links Google's ML Kit
  GenAI library (com.google.mlkit:genai-prompt) and its dependencies, which are not part of this
  repository and are used under their own licences and Google's terms. They are downloaded by
  Gradle at build time.
- AI services the user can choose in the coach (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini, DeepSeek) are
  reached over their public HTTPS APIs with the user's own key; none of their code is included.
